<title>USA: Computer Outsourcing Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>Computer Outsourcing Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six Months Ended  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				   April 30,	     April 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
